96|n|The act of abrading, wearing, or rubbing off; the wearing away by friction; as, the abrasion of coins. ; The substance rubbed off. ; A superficial excoriation, with loss of substance under the form of small shreds.	N:1rgc,90,5~1rgc,90,5
