9y|a|Broken off; very steep, or craggy, as rocks, precipices, banks; precipitous; steep; as, abrupt places. ; Without notice to prepare the mind for the event; sudden; hasty; unceremonious. ; Having sudden transitions from one subject to another; unconnected. ; Suddenly terminating, as if cut off.	j:c3q,86,4~c3q,86,4
